18415","characterName":"サラ・アグニース","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"62186","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"43446"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8933"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18415"},"originalCharacterName":"サラ・アグニース","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A salamander girl possessing the element of fire."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s a leader amongst the other elementals, and an honest woman who values chivalry. She’s the most level-headed, and rarely jokes around."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She formerly served as a commander of the previous Kingdom’s elite knights, but was discharged due to pressure from her human colleagues. During her travels to hone her swordsmanship, she received a great wound, whereupon she met Erogelsus."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At first she was a bit resistant towards him, since he was only half-human, but thanks to the care he and Myil-chan gave her, she recovered. Ever since that day, she’s served as his partner."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18415"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"火のエレメントを持つトカゲ娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"騎士道を重んじ実直で精霊達の中ではリーダー格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クール&ツッコミ担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元王国騎士の切り込み隊長であったが人間たちから弾圧を受け除隊。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"剣士として修行の旅の途中、戦いで大怪我を負い主人公と出会う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"はじめは半分人間の主人公に抵抗があったが、主人公やミュルちゃんの手厚い看護の結果回復。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以来、主人公の用心棒的な存在でいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8933","sourceWorkId":"16676","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"火のエレメントを持つトカゲ娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元王国騎士で、騎士道を重んじる実直な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"牧場の警備を担当しており戦闘能力が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仲間たちの信頼も厚く、クールキャラを装っているがみんなといるのが楽しい様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"みんなには秘密にしているが乙女チックな面もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エッチなことには非常にオクテで苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強がってはみせるが赤面してしまうほどウブ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のことを密かに想い続けているので、今回の件は内心嬉しい様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"牧場では “火のエロ素” をゲットするために一生懸命奮闘する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62186"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8933","sourceWorkId":"16676","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8933","sourceWorkId":"16676","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8933","sourceWorkId":"16676","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2ac81113847665512e398613058db3dca514061446bd2ae5f6aa7d32ff8f5a37.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6f/6fa91695a5c7f6b9df2dfd6430eeca10266c830780cbf7bd67d496605faa1bd0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"加乃みるく","creatorId":"vndb:s863","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s863","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s863","name":"加乃 みるく","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:43446:62186:11511:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c18416","characterName":"ミルキー・オンディーヌ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"62187","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"43446"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8934"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18416"},"originalCharacterName":"ミルキー・オンディーヌ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"95"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A slime girl possessing the element of water."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Normally she’s as elegant and beautiful as a nymph, but she’s an extreme coward, and her negative thinking often causes trouble for the other elementals. Despite her best intentions, she’s pretty empty-headed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When she was on a walk with her fellow slime people, she became separated, got caught up in all kinds of trouble, and ended up stuck in a drain when Erogelsus found and rescued her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She didn’t have anywhere else to go, so she decided to care of him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18416"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"水のエレメントを持つスライム娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は天女のように優雅で美しいが、非常に臆病でネガティブ思考なため精霊達の中ではトラブルメーカー。本人の意思とは関係なく大ボケ担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スライム族でお散歩をしていたところ仲間とはぐれ様々なトラブルに巻き込まれながら最終的に排水溝でネバっとなっていたところを主人公達に助けられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とりわけ行くところもないので主人公のお世話になる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8934","sourceWorkId":"16676","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"水のエレメントを持つスライム娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"臆病でネガティブな性格。 あらゆる不幸が降りかかる牧場一のトラブルメーカー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人の意思とは関係なく大ボケ担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天女のように優雅で美しいが、感情が高ぶると身体がスライム化し、裸になってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"牧場の炊事を担当していて、料理だけは得意。 理由は指が切れないから。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"みんなから 「ミュルちゃん」 と呼ばれているが、本人はニュルニュルしているので 「ニュル子」 だと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エッチをしていくうちに才能が開花、様々なスライムエッチを繰り広げる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"牧場では “水のエロ素” をゲットするために一生懸命ご奉仕する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62187"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"95 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8934","sourceWorkId":"16676","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8934","sourceWorkId":"16676","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8934","sourceWorkId":"16676","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e3fea133bc20cd94ba2ffa3f29fd52b8943077432c36f6bd9c226bf0e605c3c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1b/1b2a1c370d9887615f8df316f067c626f3e9d4929d474a3e3badd20c6e903410.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"いのくちゆか","creatorId":"vndb:s590","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s590","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s590","name":"いのくち ゆか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:43446:62187:4490:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c18417","characterName":"コリン・コロン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"62188","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"43446"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8935"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18417"},"originalCharacterName":"コリン・コロン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"80"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"50"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A goblinoid possessing the element of earth."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite her loli appearance, her actual age is far greater."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She believes that she’s capable of playing dumb and smart equally well, but she’s actually a bit of a natural airhead. She tends to look at things calmly and logically."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s one of the few remaining goblinoids with dwarf blood in her veins. When Erogelsus decided to set out on his own as an elementalist, Korin-san had been working as one of his family’s servants, and decided to go with and protect him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s known Erogelsus since he was a baby, and has been with him longer than any of the other girls."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18417"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"土のエレメントを持つゴブリン娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目のロリっぷりとはうらはらに年齢はかなり上。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分ではボケもツッコミもできるユーティリティープレイヤーだと自覚しているが、本当は天然ボケ。性格は物事を冷静にとらえ論理的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ドワーフ族の血を受け継ぐ生き残りのゴブリン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が精霊使いとして独り立ちするときに、家に使用人として働いていたこりんさんは主人公のお守りとしてついてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の幼少期から知り、一番付き合いが長い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8935","sourceWorkId":"16676","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"土のエレメントを持つゴブリン娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目のロリっぷりとはうらはらに年齢はかなり上。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年寄りくさい性格。 本人曰く、見た目のロリぶりとのギャップを武器にしているらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が精霊使いとして独り立ちする時からの付き合い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"牧場のメンテナンスを担当し、錬金術やアイテムについての知識も豊富。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"知識豊富だが自信過剰になってしまい、そのことでトラブルを巻き起こしてしまうことも……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"博識なキャラだが本当は相当のお馬鹿キャラ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好奇心旺盛で様々なアイテムを駆使してエッチに取り組む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"牧場では “土のエロ素” をゲットするために一生懸命実験する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62188"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8935","sourceWorkId":"16676","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"79 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharact