ng through the sky when she smelled something good cooking at Erogelsus’ home. She floated down towards the smell, where her bright energetic personality led her to quickly make friends with everyone on the ranch, leading her to decide to live with them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18418"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"風のエレメントを持つトリ娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"マイペースで能天気。明るい性格でボケ担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"風のエレメントを行使しアクセサリなど小道具の制作が得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"牧場の整理整頓を担当する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能天気に空を飛んでいたところ主人公達の家のおいしい匂いに誘われてフラフラやってきて、明るく元気な性格なためそのまま仲良くなり暮らし始めてしまった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8936","sourceWorkId":"16676","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"風のエレメントを持つトリ娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"マイペースで能天気。 元気がいいボクっ娘で明るいムードメーカー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちゃっかりもので牧場のお掃除を担当する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"牧場のおいしい匂いに誘われてやってきて、そのまま仲良くなって牧場で暮らし始めるほど適当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"トリ目なので目が悪くコンタクトを着用している。 メガネはキライらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大きいおっぱいを摺り寄せて主人公を困らせて遊んだりするほどエッチには興味津々。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エッチを重ねるうちに本人の中のMっ気が覚醒する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"牧場では “風のエロ素” をゲットするために一生懸命いじめられる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62189"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"102 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8936","sourceWorkId":"16676","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8936","sourceWorkId":"16676","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"61 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8936","sourceWorkId":"16676","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/501de8b0e120a6848187ad21bae7ab378fdb002575f3fb92c37e1673d1737b99.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b606342ac276b63824c203ff7b98c28770f4c3583701b0d9db2f664e795c6978.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朋永真季","creatorId":"vndb:s284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s284","name":"朋永 真季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:43446:62189:6351:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c18419","characterName":"魔王ムマ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"62190","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"43446"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8937"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18419"},"originalCharacterName":"魔王ムマ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"70"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"70"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Demon Queen, a ruler with absolute authority and destructive power."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She defeated the heroes in her way and the conquered the world in practically no time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s nearly all-powerful, but she has one weak spot: Her chest is as flat as the day she was born."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In terms of power, she stands at the top of her fellow succubi and other lust demons, but lacks any kind of sex appeal. Even when she tries to be sexy, it just ends up looking ridiculous. This lack of breasts left her without any dignity before her peers."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18419"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"絶対的な権力と破壊力を持つ魔王。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇者を倒し、あっという間に世界を支配してしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全能の力を持つ彼女だが唯一弱点がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それは彼女が生まれた時から「つるぺた」であるということ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"淫魔サキュバスの中でも頂点に君臨するが、セックスアピール的な要素０。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ｈな格好をしてもふざけているようにしか見えない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"威厳なし。しかもおっぱいは「つるぺた」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8937","sourceWorkId":"16676","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"絶対的な権力と破壊力を持つ魔王。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇者を倒し、あっという間に世界を支配した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全能の力を持つ彼女だが唯一の弱点は “つるぺた” なこと。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"サキュバスの頂点に君臨するが、つるぺたのロリなため全く威厳なし。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかも勇者との激しい戦いでサキュバスの淫らな力を失う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"イジワルでわがまま。 ゴキゲンを取らないと破壊的な技を使ってくる恐ろしい魔王。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人は “つるぺた” にものすごくコンプレックスを抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怒ると一時的に淫らな術が使えるようになるらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の願いは “淫者の石” を手に入れて、ボンキュッボンなエロエロボディになること！"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62190"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"70 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8937","sourceWorkId":"16676","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"70 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8937","sourceWorkId":"16676","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"45 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8937","sourceWorkId":"16676","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e4dde3b4371a80a05e1646270379e3f842c40ea4375c3337e00ecc4adfba9888.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e5dde2c939129478cf1ef7bbad5e6f513515773b2e58e296dc2b4e8374b3de2d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"瑞森柚子","creatorId":"egs:creator:36244","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:36244","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:36244","name":"瑞森柚子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:ch